  "notes": "FORMS:\nCompound verb: ⟦{引|ひ}く→引く：01978_hiku⟧ (to pull) + ⟦{掻|か}く→掻く：09647_kaku⟧ (to scratch).\nThe {引|ひ}っ- prefix intensifies the scratching action.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{爪|つめ}→爪：02159_tsume⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{引|ひ}っ{掻|か}く - to scratch with nails\n- ⟦{猫|ねこ}→猫：02237_neko⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{引|ひ}っ{掻|か}かれる - to be scratched by a cat\n- ⟦{傷|きず}→傷：02201_kizu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{引|ひ}っ{掻|か}く - to scratch a wound\n\nWRITING:\n⟦{掻|か}く→掻く：09647_kaku⟧ is often written in hiragana as かく because the kanji {掻|か} is uncommon.",
